Welcome home. You are kitty, and this directory is yours.

Things to try from here:
  rc /rc/cc hello.c          compile and run hello.c (C-toolchain boot only)
  python hello.py            real CPython 3.14
  gotest                     a real Go binary, unmodified
  win acme &                 the real acme, in a window
  rc /rc/tour                the guided tour

Everything you make lives only in this tab, and a reload forgets it.
